g class="game_cover" src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI4NzM2NjkyLnBuZw==/315x250%23c/8XdeWt.png"/></a><div class="game_screenshots"><a href="https://img.itch.zone/aW1hZ2UvNDgxOTI1My8yODczNzA5NC5wbmc=/original/DLSy9x.png" target="_blank" data-image_lightbox="true"><img class="screenshot" src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1hZ2UvNDgxOTI1My8yODczNzA5NC5wbmc=/147x117%23/h21Pdj.png" data-screenshot_id="28737094"/></a><a href="https://img.itch.zone/aW1hZ2UvNDgxOTI1My8yODczNzEwMS5wbmc=/original/lcHZZP.png" target="_blank" data-image_lightbox="true"><img class="screenshot" src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1hZ2UvNDgxOTI1My8yODczNzEwMS5wbmc=/147x117%23/oL4CPF.png" data-screenshot_id="28737101"/></a><a href="https://img.itch.zone/aW1hZ2UvNDgxOTI1My8yODczNzEwMi5wbmc=/original/xvnxnb.png" target="_blank" data-image_lightbox="true"><img class="screenshot" src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1hZ2UvNDgxOTI1My8yODczNzEwMi5wbmc=/147x117%23/NwqrW2.png" data-screenshot_id="28737102"/></a><a href="https://img.itch.zone/aW1hZ2UvNDgxOTI1My8yODczNzEwNS5wbmc=/original/1chq%2B2.png" target="_blank" data-image_lightbox="true"><img class="screenshot" src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1hZ2UvNDgxOTI1My8yODczNzEwNS5wbmc=/147x117%23/covHJM.png" data-screenshot_id="28737105"/></a><a href="https://img.itch.zone/aW1hZ2UvNDgxOTI1My8yODczNzEwNy5wbmc=/original/DvH%2F4c.png" target="_blank" data-image_lightbox="true"><img class="screenshot" src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1hZ2UvNDgxOTI1My8yODczNzEwNy5wbmc=/147x117%23/vjabCA.png" data-screenshot_id="28737107"/></a></div></div><div class="main_column"><section class="visit_game"><h2>Play viprpg</h2><a class="button fat play_btn" href="https://x-raniu-viprpg.itch.io/sm2026teimer-xrani">もしもモンスターテイマー＋α（X-羅仁宇Ver.）&#039;s itch.io page<svg class="svgicon icon_arrow_up_right" version="1.1" width="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" role="img" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden height="24"><line x1="7" y1="17" x2="17" y2="7"></line><polyline points="7 7 17 7 17 17"></polyline></svg></a></section><section class="jam_comment_form"><h2>Leave a comment</h2><p class="form_placeholder"><a href="/login?return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fitch.io%2Fjam%2Fviprpg-summer-2026%2Frate%2F4819253" data-register_action="comment">Log in with itch.io</a> to leave a comment.</p></section><section id="comments" class="jam_comment_list"><h2>Comments</h2><div id="community_topic_posts_4535660" class="community_topic_posts_widget base_widget"><div id="community_post_list_4377283" class="community_post_list_widget base_widget"><div class="community_post sidebar_avatar has_replies" data-post="{&quot;user_id&quot;:13385794,&quot;id&quot;:17066124}" id="post-17066124"><div id="first-post" class="post_anchor"></div><div id="last-post" class="post_anchor"></div><div class="post_grid"><a class="avatar_container" href="/profile/hagure-22"><div class="post_avatar" style="background-image: url(https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI5MTU0NTkyLnBuZw==/80x80%23/gDf8HQ.png)"></div></a><div class="post_header"><span class="post_author"><a href="/profile/hagure-22">はぐれ者＠VIPRPG</a></span><span title="2026-08-19 14:03:14" class="post_date"><a href="/post/17066124">62 days ago</a></span><span class="vote_counts"><span class="upvotes">(+1)</span></span></div><div class="post_content"><div class="post_body user_formatted" dir="auto"><p>ひとまず片方でクリアしました。</p><p>何かしらのバトルがあるとは思ったけど、数値バトルだったのは面食らいました。<br>このバトルシステムはかなり大昔のスレゲーでやったことあるけど、もしかしてそれが元ですかね。<br>ただ、あまりにも一本道すぎるのでイベント総当たりで簡単にクリアできてしまったのが残念なところです。<br>もうちょっと悩ませるところが欲しかった。</p><p>ストーリーに関してもせっかく新キャラデビューなのに、予定調和の魔王把握展開にはしてほしくなかった。<br>正直、今のVIPRPG事情でこのやり方は悪手のような気がします。<br>危機レベルとまではいかなくとも、何か騒動が起きて収拾するするというものがあってよかったはず。<br>外から来たキャラなのだから他と触れ合う意味でもその辺は重要だと思いますね。</p><p>予告見て前も言ったかもしれませんが、VIPRPGの中ではこれまでに無いタイプのキャラなので、<br>これまでの追従路線でなく新しい方向性で展開してほしいなと思います。</p></div><div class="post_footer"><a data-register_action="community_vote" href="/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fitch.io%2Fjam%2Fviprpg-summer-2026%2Frate%2F4819253" class="post_action vote_btn"><span class="icon-like"></span><span class="like_text"> Like</span></a><a href="/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fitch.io%2Fjam%2Fviprpg-summer-2026%2Frate%2F4819253" data-register_action="community_reply" class="post_action reply_btn">Reply</a></div></div></div></div><div class="community_post_replies top_level_replies"><div class="community_post is_reply" data-post="{&quot;user_id&quot;:9347428,&quot;id&quot;:17100033}" id="post-17100033"><div class="post_grid"><a class="avatar_container" href="/profile/x-raniu-viprpg"><div class="post_avatar" style="background-image: url(https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzE0MjkyNDg4LnBuZw==/25x25%23/MdwzYk.png)"></div></a><div class="post_header"><span class="post_author"><a href="/profile/x-raniu-viprpg">X-羅仁宇@VIPRPGツクラー</a></span><span class="author_flag owner" data-slug="developer">Developer</span><span title="2026-08-23 15:59:07" class="post_date"><a href="/post/17100033">58 days ago</a></span><span class="vote_counts"></span></div><div class="post_content"><div class="post_body user_formatted" dir="auto"><p>PIAIありがとうございます。</p>
<p>本作は、メインで製作中の作品がある中であまり時間をかけたくなかった為に</p>
<p>極力ややこしすぎず、（自分の中にある）もしもシリーズらしさも加味した上</p>
<p>シンプルな形にしようとした結果、この形の作品になりました。</p></div><div class="post_footer"><a data-register_action="community_vote" href="/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fitch.io%2Fjam%2Fviprpg-summer-2026%2Frate%2F4819253" class="post_action vote_btn"><span class="icon-like"></span><span class="like_text"> Like</span></a><a href="/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fitch.io%2Fjam%2Fviprpg-summer-2026%2Frate%2F4819253" data-register_action="community_reply" class="post_action reply_btn">Reply</a></div></div></div></div></div><script id="vote_counts_tpl" type="text/template"><% if (up_score > 0) { %><span class="upvotes">(+{{up_score}})</span><% } %><% if (down_score > 0) { %><span class="downvotes">(-{{down_score}})</span><% } %></script></div></div></section></div></div></div></div><div class="footer"><div class="primary"><div class="social"><a href="https://twitter.com/itchio"><span class="icon icon-twitter" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="screenreader_only">itch.io on Twitter</span></a><a href="https://www.facebook.com/itchiogames"><span class="icon icon-facebook" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="screenreader_only">itch.io on Facebook</span></a></div><a href="/docs/general/about">About</a><a href="/docs/general/faq">FAQ</a><a href="/blog">Blog</a><a href="/support">Contact us</a></div><div class="secondary"><span class="copyright">Copyright © 2026 itch corp</span><span class="spacer"> · </span><a href="/directory">Directory</a><span class="spacer"> · </span><a href="/docs/legal/terms" rel="nofollow">Terms</a><span class="spacer"> · </span><a href="/docs/legal/privacy-policy" rel="nofollow">Privacy</a><span class="spacer"> · </span><a href="/docs/legal/cookie-policy" rel="nofollow">Cookies</a></div></div><script id="loading_lightbox_tpl" type="text/template"><div class="lightbox loading_lightbox" aria-live="polite"><div class="loader_outer"><div class="loader_label">Loading</div><div class="loader_bar"><div class="loader_bar_slider"></div></div></div></div></script><script type="text/javascript">new I.CommunityViewTopic('#community_topic_posts_4535660', {"report_url":"\/post\/:post_id\/report"});init_JamRateGame('#jam_rate_game_2648834', {"id":4819253,"type_name":"default","type":1,"slug":"sm2026teimer-xrani","min_price":0,"actual_price":0});init_Header('#header_6160881', {"autocomplete_props":{"ca_source":25,"ca_types":{"browse_facet":8,"game":1,"jam":4,"bundle":6,"featured_tag":7},"autocomplete_url":"\/autocomplete","search_url":"\/search","i18n":{"search_placeholder":"Search for games, jams, tags or creators","search":"Search"}}});
